1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,900
Hey! Hey! Hey!

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,200
Nguyễn Hiền ơi! Nguyễn Hiền ơi!

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,200
