4
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,900
Hai nghìn lẻ ba!

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,200
Hai mươi ba năm!

6
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,400
Hôm nay ta trở về!

7
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,900
Are you ready?

8
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,400
