66
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,900
Tất cả cùng giơ tay!

67
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:35,200
Ba! Hai! Một! LET’S GO!

68
00:03:47,500 --> 00:03:49,200
Nguyễn Hiền! Nguyễn Hiền!

69
00:03:49,300 --> 00:03:50,900
